{"candidateAnswer":"John conducts seminars and mentors younger players.","evidence":"[D14:3 | 1:50 pm on 17 October, 2023] John: Seems like forever since we caught up! I'm now mentoring the younger players on my team. It's super rewarding and I'm loving sharing my skills and knowledge with them. It's also a great way for me to stay involved in the game during the off-season.\n[D26:1 | 3:35 pm on 26 December, 2023] John: Hey Tim! Great to hear from you. My week's been busy - I started doing seminars, helping people with their sports and marketing. It's been awesome!","itemId":"urn:uuid:5be2da28-a348-503c-aadd-94d07a4158fd","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:f4e2982a0e5afbe4d389915b225f2ec50b70f2268d6a120655bfeff609ea5a1a","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What does John do to share his knowledge?","referenceAnswer":"gives seminars, mentors younger players.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"f4e2982a0e5afbe4d389915b225f2ec50b70f2268d6a120655bfeff609ea5a1a"}}]}